WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.435
An AI agent was given a task.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.940
Here is how it went, step by step.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.156
It took 32 seconds, with ten tool calls

00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:10.194
and two files changed.

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:13.432
First it looked through the project, then went

00:00:13.432 --> 00:00:15.720
back and forth: it ran commands and changed

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.880
files.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.641
Its most used tool was Bash, with six

00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:21.775
calls, followed by Edit.

00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:24.807
At step 5, a command failed.

00:00:24.807 --> 00:00:27.174
Four steps later, the same command ran without

00:00:27.174 --> 00:00:28.026
an error.

00:00:28.026 --> 00:00:29.953
Two calls failed in all.

00:00:30.903 --> 00:00:33.330
The biggest single edit was to wordfreq dot

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.655
test dot J S: four lines added and

00:00:35.655 --> 00:00:37.457
zero removed.

00:00:38.407 --> 00:00:40.638
It finished with six lines added and three

00:00:40.638 --> 00:00:42.684
removed, across two files.

00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:44.553
This was its last message.

00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:46.695
Made with trace studio.

00:00:46.695 --> 00:00:49.447
The transcript was anonymised before this video was

00:00:49.447 --> 00:00:50.342
made.
